  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;a vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is obtained by rotating the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>p</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> by an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> about origin in counter clockwise direction. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
